---
Resume a paused destination

Usage: vendo destinations resume [OPTIONS] <destinationId>

Arguments:
  <destinationId>  

Options:
      --config-file <path>  JSON request with expectedUpdatedAt, maintenance (pause) and optional approved decisionId
      --json                Output raw JSON
      --dry-run             Preview the action without executing
      --output <field>      Print a single field (e.g. id)
  -h, --help                Print help

Global options:
      --profile <name>  Use a specific account profile (or set VENDO_PROFILE)
      --debug           Enable verbose request diagnostics

Examples:
  $ vendo destinations resume <destinationId> --config-file resume.json
  $ vendo destinations resume <destinationId> --dry-run
